{title: MICHAEL ROW THE BOAT ASHORE (In C)}
{subtitle: The Highwaymen-Peter, Paul & Mary}
Two versions here, first for the Highwaymen, and afterwards for Peter, Paul, & Mary who add some verses the Highwaymen do not.  The music is the same except for the different capo settings.  There's also a version in G available.

